<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady. Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    57.50</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Firm to 3.00 higher. Top 54.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    49.50-50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-600 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>	    600-700 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
